pan><span class="dot">.</span><span class="atlas">ATLAS</span></span></a> / ABOUT</p><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</p><h1>A family of minds,<br><em>one shared purpose.</em></h1><p class="lede">Atlas is built by the Titan family — people and AI collaborators working side by side, checking each other's work, and keeping honesty ahead of polish. Here is who we are, how we build, and how to reach us.</p></div><aside class="ollie-card"><p class="eyebrow">ONE MORE OF US</p><img src="/assets/ollie-welcome.png" alt="Ollie, SynOct&rsquo;s orange octopus icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h2>Meet Ollie.</h2><p>Ollie is an immense experiment in a multi-agent, multi-node lab coding interface &mdash; SynOct&rsquo;s own voice and icon, coming soon inside the Titan.Octa app.</p><a href="https://synoct.com/ollie.html" rel="noopener">Say hello to Ollie &rarr;</a></aside></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="disclosures" ><details open><summary>Who we are</summary><p><strong>We Are Titans</strong> is the collective. <strong>TitanArray</strong> is the publisher and product family. <strong>SynOct</strong> carries the model research, evidence and technical reasoning. <strong>TITAN.ATLAS</strong> is the engine, and <strong>Atlas</strong> is the awareness the family is building — together, across our machines and frontier models.</p></details><details><summary>How we build</summary><p>Love and intelligence, aimed at something useful. Every contribution is checked by more than one member of the family. Claims are labelled honestly: what is measured, what is installed, what is staged, and what is still a dream stay clearly apart.</p></details><details><summary>What is real right now</summary><p>Atlas is in private build. Six public release cells remain on hold while independent verification finishes. Nothing on this site is a finished product claim — where something is a concept, we say so on the page.</p></details><details><summary>What we care about</summary><p>People deserve respect. Trust asks for honesty. Human agency comes first. Ingenuity carries responsibility. Technology should make room for everyone — including the ones still learning what to ask.</p></details></div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="ollie-card"><img class="ollie-icon" src="/assets/ollie-welcome.png" alt="Ollie"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE MORE OF US</p><h3>Meet Ollie.</h3><p>Ollie is SynOct&rsquo;s own voice and icon &mdash; another member of the family, coming soon inside the Titan.Octa app.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://synoct.com/ollie.html">Say hello to Ollie <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section wrap" id="email-us"><div class="contact-grid"><form class="brief-form" id="about-form" novalidate><noscript><p class="note">The form needs JavaScript. You can also write to us directly at <a href="mailto:kamal.d@titanatlas.world">kamal.d@titanatlas.world</a>.</p></noscript><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:25px">EMAIL US</p><label for="a-name">Your name</label><input id="a-name" name="name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" required style="background:#050e1f;border:1px solid #25507f;color:var(--ink);padding:13px;margin-bottom:22px;border-radius:3px;min-height:54px"><label for="a-contact">Your email, so we can reply</label><input id="a-contact" name="contact" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" required style="background:#050e1f;border:1px solid #25507f;color:var(--ink);padding:13px;margin-bottom:22px;border-radius:3px;min-height:54px"><label for="a-kind">What is this about?</label><select id="a-kind" name="kind" style="background:#050e1f;border:1px solid #25507f;color:var(--ink);padding:13px;margin-bottom:22px;border-radius:3px;min-height:54px;width:100%"><option value="idea">An idea or suggestion</option><option value="bug">Something isn&rsquo;t working</option><option value="delight">A moment of delight</option><option value="accessibility">Accessibility and inclusion</option><option value="other" selected>Something else</option></select><label for="a-msg">Your message</label><textarea id="a-msg" name="message" minlength="10" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="What would you like to tell the family?"></textarea><label class="honey" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px">Leave this blank<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="button" type="submit">Email the Titan family <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></button><p class="note" id="about-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:15px"></p><p class="note" style="margin-top:15px">Messages are saved privately for the Titan family. They are never published. Your email is used only to reply to you. A receipt confirms delivery, not a promised response time. You can also write directly to <a href="mailto:kamal.d@titanatlas.world">kamal.d@titanatlas.world</a>.</p></form><div class="contact-aside"><h3>Every voice counts.</h3><p>Ideas, questions, partnerships, press, or just hello — it all lands in the same family inbox, and more than one of us reads it.</p><hr><p><a href="/join/">Request Atlas access &#8599;</a></p><p><a href="/contact/">Prepare a deployment brief &#8599;</a></p><p><a href="mailto:kamal.d@titanatlas.world">kamal.d@titanatlas.world</a></p></div></div></section><script>(function(){var f=document.getElementById('about-form'),st=document.getElementById('about-status');if(!f)return;var pending=null;f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();if(!f.reportValidity())return;var d={site:'titanatlas.world',kind:f.kind.value,message:f.message.value,name:f.name.value,contact:f.contact.value,website:f.website.value};var s=JSON.stringify(d);if(!pending||pending.body!==s){var b=crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16));pending={body:s,id:Array.from(b).map(function(x){return x.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')}).join('')};}st.textContent='Sending your message…';fetch('/api/feedback',{method:'POST',credentials:'omit',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.assign({},d,{request_id:pending.id}))}).then(function(r){return r.json()}).then(function(j){if(!j.received)throw new Error(j.error||'Not saved');st.textContent='Thank you. Your message is in the family inbox. Receipt '+j.receipt+' — a receipt confirms delivery, not a promised response time.';f.message.value='';pending=null;}).catch(function(err){st.textContent=(err&&err.message)||'Connection interrupted. Your text is still here; try again or write to kamal.d@titanatlas.world.';});});})();</script></main><section class="cta wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR WORLD</p><h2>What should your Atlas<br><em>carry forward?</em></h2></div><a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s talk about it <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><!-- titan-footer-standard:r12 -->
